# "tar éis" (after, past) counts UP from the named hour: "leathuair tar éis
# a trí" is 03:30 and "ceathrú tar éis a trí" is 03:15.  Ulster substitutes
# "i ndiaidh".  Sources: en.wiktionary.org, https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/tar_éis and
# https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/i_ndiaidh; omniglot.com "Time in Irish";
# bitesize.irish "How To Say What Time It Is in Irish".
tar éis
i ndiaidh
